Package: qnp
Title: Plots for Quarto Notes
Version: 1.0.2.9005
Authors@R: c(
    person("Douglas Ezra", "Morrison", , "ezra.morrison@wwu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Helpers for including plots in Quarto notes.
    Provides 'interactive_plot()', which renders a 'ggplot2' plot as an
    interactive 'plotly' widget with a text alternative in HTML output,
    and leaves the plot unchanged in other output formats.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Morrison-Lab/qnp, https://morrison-lab.github.io/qnp/
BugReports: https://github.com/Morrison-Lab/qnp/issues
